journey-map Customer Onboarding

persona New Customer color: blue
  Team lead at a 40-person company
  Evaluating the product on a two-week trial

[Discover]
  Reads a comparison article score: 3, emotion: Curious
    thought: Could this replace the spreadsheet we keep fighting?
  Watches the product demo score: 4, emotion: Interested

[Sign Up]
  Creates an account score: 4, emotion: Hopeful
    description: Email, password and a workspace name
  Waits for the verification email score: 2, emotion: Impatient
    pain: The email lands in spam and takes ten minutes to find

[First Use]
  Imports existing data score: 2, emotion: Frustrated
    pain: The CSV importer rejects two columns without saying why
    opportunity: Show a preview with the rejected columns highlighted
  Invites the team score: 4, emotion: Relieved

[Adopt]
  Runs the first weekly review in the tool score: 5, emotion: Confident
    description: The whole team works from one shared board
  Upgrades to a paid plan score: 4, emotion: Satisfied
    thought: Worth it if it saves an hour a week
